#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:9
msgid "The short version"
msgstr "छोटो सारांश"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:10
msgid ""
"HamroNepal only uses cookies that are strictly necessary to make the site "
"work: keeping you signed in, protecting your account, and remembering your "
"language choice. We do not use advertising cookies, tracking cookies, or any"
" third-party analytics, so we don't show a cookie consent banner — there is "
"nothing non-essential to ask your permission for. You can still control "
"cookies through your browser settings at any time."
msgstr ""
"HamroNepal ले साइट चलाउन अत्यावश्यक कुकीहरू मात्र प्रयोग गर्छ: तपाईंलाई साइन"
" इन राख्ने, तपाईंको खाता सुरक्षित गर्ने, र तपाईंको भाषा रोजाइ सम्झने। हामी "
"विज्ञापन कुकी, ट्र्याकिङ कुकी, वा कुनै तेस्रो-पक्ष एनालिटिक्स प्रयोग "
"गर्दैनौं, त्यसैले हामी कुकी सहमति ब्यानर देखाउँदैनौं — अनुमति माग्नुपर्ने "
"गैर-अत्यावश्यक केही छैन। तपाईं जुनसुकै बेला आफ्नो ब्राउजर सेटिङबाट कुकी "
"नियन्त्रण गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:14
msgid "Cookies we use"
msgstr "हामीले प्रयोग गर्ने कुकीहरू"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:19
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "कुकी"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:20
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "उद्देश्य"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:21
#: templates/processes/process_detail.html:43
#: templates/processes/process_detail.html:46
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "अवधि"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:27
msgid "Keeps you signed in between page visits."
msgstr "तपाईंलाई पृष्ठहरू बीच साइन इन राख्छ।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:28
msgid "Expires when your browser session ends."
msgstr "तपाईंको ब्राउजर सत्र समाप्त हुँदा समाप्त हुन्छ।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:32
msgid "Protects your account and forms from cross-site request forgery."
msgstr ""
"तपाईंको खाता र फारमहरूलाई क्रस-साइट रिक्वेस्ट फोर्जरीबाट सुरक्षा गर्छ।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:33
#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:38
msgid "About one year."
msgstr "लगभग एक वर्ष।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:37
msgid "Remembers whether you chose English or Nepali."
msgstr "तपाईंले अङ्ग्रेजी वा नेपाली मध्ये कुन रोज्नुभयो भनी सम्झन्छ।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:46
msgid "What we don't use"
msgstr "हामीले प्रयोग नगर्ने कुराहरू"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:47
msgid ""
"We don't run Google Analytics, advertising pixels, or any other third-party "
"tracking script. Fonts and other assets on this site are hosted by us "
"directly, not loaded from a third-party CDN, so visiting HamroNepal doesn't "
"send your browser data to outside companies."
msgstr ""
"हामी Google Analytics, विज्ञापन पिक्सेल, वा अन्य कुनै तेस्रो-पक्ष ट्र्याकिङ "
"स्क्रिप्ट चलाउँदैनौं। यस साइटका फन्ट र अन्य एसेटहरू हामी आफैंले होस्ट "
"गर्छौं, तेस्रो-पक्ष CDN बाट लोड गरिँदैन, त्यसैले HamroNepal भ्रमण गर्दा "
"तपाईंको ब्राउजर डेटा बाहिरी कम्पनीहरूमा जाँदैन।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:51
msgid "Controlling cookies"
msgstr "कुकी नियन्त्रण गर्ने"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:52
msgid ""
"Every browser lets you block or delete cookies in its settings. Since our "
"cookies are what keep you signed in, blocking them will sign you out and "
"stop the language preference from being remembered, but the public parts of "
"the site will still work."
msgstr ""
"हरेक ब्राउजरले आफ्नो सेटिङमा कुकी ब्लक वा मेटाउन दिन्छ। हाम्रा कुकीहरूले नै "
"तपाईंलाई साइन इन राख्ने भएकाले, तिनलाई ब्लक गर्दा तपाईं साइन आउट हुनुहुनेछ र"
" भाषा रोजाइ सम्झिने छैन, तर साइटका सार्वजनिक भागहरू भने चलिरहनेछन्।"

#: templates/core/legal/cookie_policy.html:56
